        "Content": "82 Mangerton Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12, D12 X2P3\r\n\r\nBeds: 3 | Baths: 1 | Type: Mid-Terrace House\r\n\r\nProperty Overview\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Ireland are delighted to present No. 82 Mangerton Road—a charming 3-bedroom home featuring a shaker-style kitchen, fully tiled bathroom, and a private paved rear garden, set down a safe, quiet cul-de-sac in Dublin 12.\r\n\r\nDescription\r\n\r\nKeller Williams Ireland are proud to bring No. 82 Mangerton Road to the Dublin 12 market. Tucked away on an exceptionally safe, quiet cul-de-sac with zero through-traffic, this solid 3-bedroom property offers peace, privacy, and fantastic potential, while keeping you just minutes from Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nStepping inside, the ground floor is finished with warm, durable wooden flooring throughout, creating a seamless and light-filled living space. The kitchen features classic shaker-style units with excellent storage. Double patio doors open directly from the living space onto a private, fully paved rear garden—ideal for low-maintenance outdoor living, summer dining, and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, complete with custom built-in wardrobes fitted in both main double bedrooms. The accommodation is completed by a stylish, fully tiled family bathroom. To the front, the property benefits from a gated driveway providing off-street parking.\r\n\r\nWhile carrying an F-rating BER, the property presents an exciting opportunity for buyers to modernize energy efficiency, take advantage of SEAI retrofitting grants, or put their own stamp on a classic D12 home.\r\n\r\nMangerton Road enjoys an unbeatable location close to local shops, primary and secondary schools, Crumlin Hospital, and Grand Canal walks. Transport links are exceptional: the Blackhorse LUAS stop (Red Line) is within easy walking distance, alongside major bus routes (122, 123, 151, 27) and rapid access to the M50 motor network.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing with Keller Williams Ireland is strongly recommended.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nQuiet Cul-De-Sac: Tucked away on a safe, family-friendly road with no through-traffic.\r\n\r\nShaker-Style Kitchen: Beautifully appointed kitchen units with practical storage.\r\n\r\nFully Tiled Bathroom: Contemporary family bathroom tiled wall-to-floor.\r\n\r\nBuilt-In Storage: Fitted built-in wardrobes in both main double bedrooms.\r\n\r\nGround Floor Finish: Sleek wooden floors running throughout the downstairs.\r\n\r\nLow-Maintenance Garden: Patio doors opening onto a private, fully paved rear garden.\r\n\r\nRetrofit Potential: Clear scope to upgrade energy efficiency with SEAI grant support.\r\n\r\nTransport Links: Short walk to the Blackhorse LUAS stop and direct city bus corridors.\r\n\r\nParking: Gated front driveway with off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Summary\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: Warm wooden flooring, under-stairs storage space.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: Bright, welcoming reception area with wooden floors.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area: Shaker-style fitted units, wooden floors, and patio door access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master): Spacious double bedroom to the front with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Rear-facing double bedroom featuring fitted built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Bright single room ideal as a nursery or dedicated home office.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: Fully tiled modern bathroom with WC, WHB, and shower unit.\r\n\r\nRear Garden: Private, paved patio garden designed for low-upkeep outdoor living.\r\n\r\nBER Details\r\n\r\nBER: F | BER No: [Insert Number] | Energy Performance Indicator: [Insert Value] kWh/m²/yr\r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\n\r\nStrictly by appointment with Keller Williams Ireland. Contact our team today to register your interest."
      },
